This directory contains code vendored from google-research/ibc
(https://github.com/google-research/ibc), the reference implementation
accompanying "Implicit Behavioral Cloning" (Florence et al., CoRL 2021).

    Copyright 2024 The Reach ML Authors.

The vendored code is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy
is provided in the LICENSE file in this directory. Modifications made here:

  * Removed the tf_agents-dependent oracle and metric modules, and the
    multimodal / discontinuous task variants, none of which this project uses.
  * Replaced the `gin` configuration dependency with no-op stubs (see
    __init__.py), since parameters are set directly in Python.
  * Patched `utils/utils_pybullet.load_urdf` to resolve asset paths against
    this package's `assets/` directory instead of internal Google paths.
